    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79073" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραφύω</span></b> , with fut. and aor.
		1, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>produce at the
